          <ui:InvokeCode ContinueOnError="{x:Null}" Code="' Loop through each row and check for &quot;Opening Balance&quot; or &quot;DO NOT COMMENT ANYWHERE ON THIS FOOTER&quot;&#xA;For Each row As DataRow In dtGlStatement.Rows.Cast(Of DataRow)().ToList()&#xA;    ' Check if the Narration is &quot;OPENING BALANCE&quot;&#xA;    If row(&quot;Narration&quot;).ToString().ToUpper().Contains(&quot;OPENING BALANCE&quot;) OrElse&#xA;       row(&quot;Booking Date&quot;).ToString().ToUpper().Contains(&quot;DO NOT COMMENT ANYWHERE ON THIS FOOTER&quot;) Then&#xA;        ' Remove the row from dtGlStatement&#xA;        dtGlStatement.Rows.Remove(row)&#xA;    End If&#xA;Next&#xA;" DisplayName="Remove Open and Close Bal" sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="416,197.33333333333334" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="InvokeCode_25">
